  "description": "Conversion of dwelling into two flats (2 X 2 bed);single and two storey side and rear extensions; rear dormer; parking; separate amenity space; bin and cycle stores.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of its failure to provide a 3-bedroom, 4 person family-size unit on either ground or first floor combined with its low Public Transport Accessibility Level (PTAL) rating and the original internal floor area of the existing dwelling being less than 130sqm, would have a detrimental impact on the character, stock of family sized housing and amenity of local areas, contrary to HO2 of the Emerging Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
